type: dataset
title: "Quillon Auto Group CRM: a synthetic Salesforce-style dealership dataset"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-20
authors:
  - family-names: "YOUR LAST NAME"
    given-names: "YOUR FIRST NAME"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A fully synthetic, anonymised CRM dataset for a fictional 12-showroom car dealership group:
  500,000 leads, 190,007 showroom deals (76,585 vehicles sold, 15.3% of leads), 2.7M calls, texts
  and emails, and 507k appointments, test drives and deliveries, in Salesforce object format.
  Built for practising lead scoring, funnel analytics, SQL and CRM data modelling.
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - CRM
  - Salesforce
  - lead scoring
  - automotive
  - sales funnel
